---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Shield } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com"
  description="Privacy Policy for FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com. Learn about our 100% on-device processing and zero-server data storage policy."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-12 space-y-8 sm:space-y-10 w-full max-w-full overflow-hidden">
    <div class="text-center space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex p-3 bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 rounded-2xl mb-1">
        <Shield class="w-8 h-8 text-rose-700" />
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl min-[360px]:text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-serif">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm">Effective Date: November 2026 • DPDP Act 2023 Compliant</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-10 border border-slate-200/80 shadow-md space-y-6 sm:space-y-8 text-slate-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">1. On-Device Processing & Zero Server Retention Policy</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>FreeMarriageBiodataMaker.com</strong>, user privacy is our foundational pillar. All information you input into your biodata—including full names, dates of birth, religious and astrological details, family contacts, and uploaded photos—is <strong>never transmitted to, stored on, or processed by any external server or database</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          All formatting, image rendering, and PDF generation occur entirely within your own web browser's local memory (Client-Side). As soon as you close or refresh your browser tab, that temporary memory is cleared.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">2. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p>
          We do not require user account registration, login credentials, phone numbers, or email addresses to use our service. We do not collect or sell Personally Identifiable Information (PII) to any third parties or marketing agencies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">3. Cookies & Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain this tool 100% free of charge for all families across India, we may display third-party advertisements via network partners such as Google AdSense.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-600">
          <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on prior visits to this or other websites.</li>
          <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-rose-700 underline font-semibold">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">4. Contacting Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions or inquiries regarding our privacy practices, you can contact our privacy officer through our <a href="/contact" class="text-rose-700 underline font-semibold">Contact Us</a> page.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
